# A single quad with the aspect ratio of the 256x160 banner texture, with UVs
# spanning the whole image. obj2dl bakes the UVs in texel units against the
# real (untrimmed) height, which is what both the trimmed and the padded
# conversion of banner.png stores in rows 0..159.
#
# This file is part of Nitro Engine Advanced

o Banner

v -1.600000 -1.000000 0.000000
v  1.600000 -1.000000 0.000000
v  1.600000  1.000000 0.000000
v -1.600000  1.000000 0.000000

vt 0.000000 0.000000
vt 1.000000 0.000000
vt 1.000000 1.000000
vt 0.000000 1.000000

vn 0.000000 0.000000 1.000000

f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1 4/4/1
